Welcome to recuerd0!

Your account is ready. recuerd0 is a knowledge base for your AI workflows — organize, version, and serve project context to any LLM.

What you can do:

- Workspaces — organize memories by project or topic
- Memories — save context with full markdown, tagging, and versioning
- Search — find anything with full-text search across all your content

Where to start:

We created My Workspace for you with four seeded memories:

- Map — how this workspace is kept
- Continuation Brief
- Index — decisions
- D001 — the first decision

The Getting Started guide takes you from zero to your first import in a few minutes.

Developer tools:

- REST API — programmatic access with personal access tokens
- CLI — manage workspaces and memories from the terminal
- AI Agents — integrate recuerd0 as a context source for your AI tools

